Query language
- crates/query/src/{lib,parser}.rs: query hoisting, the balanced-pattern and delimited-pattern
  scanners, the order of parse attempts and several error messages, after
  internal/search/query (parser.go, transformer.go). Test cases in crates/query come from
  TestParse, TestParseAndOrLiteral and TestHoist.

Batch spec templates (lib/batches)
- crates/batches-template/src/partial.rs: after lib/batches/template/partial_eval.go.
- crates/batches-template/src/{validate,context}.rs: template validation and the step and
  changeset template contexts, after lib/batches/template/templating.go.
- crates/batches-template/tests/templates.rs: test cases and fixtures from templating_test.go
  and partial_eval_test.go.

Batch specs and changesets (lib/batches)
- crates/batches/src/spec/{published,env,checks}.rs, crates/batches/src/changeset_spec.rs:
  error messages and method names after lib/batches/overridable, lib/batches/env,
  batch_spec.go and changeset_spec.go.
- crates/batches-steps/src/changeset.rs: after lib/batches/changeset_specs.go
  (BuildChangesetSpecs).
- crates/batches/tests/batch_spec.rs: the if-condition table from batch_spec_test.go.

